{"id":"57f828f5424bec03","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-ineffable.md","title":"Ineffable Cardinal","display":"df-ineffable — Ineffable Cardinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-ineffable","aliases":["58-df-ineffable"],"display":"df-ineffable — Ineffable Cardinal","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-ineffable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-ineffable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ineffable — Ineffable Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b802c3dd76418d95\" href=\"?note=b802c3dd76418d95\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md\">../batch19/58-df-stationary.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\vec A,A\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\vec A,A\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{Stationary}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{Stationary}\\)</span> (predicates from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ineffable}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ineffable}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (ineffable-cardinal predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ineffable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ineffable}(\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\omega_1\\subseteq\\kappa\n\\land\n\\forall\\vec A\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,\\kappa,\\mathcal P(\\kappa))\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(\\vec A(\\alpha)\\subseteq\\alpha)\n\\to\n\\exists A\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\n\\mathrm{Stationary}\n(\\{\\alpha\\in\\kappa:A\\cap\\alpha=\\vec A(\\alpha)\\},\\kappa)\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ineffable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ineffable}(\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\omega_1\\subseteq\\kappa\n\\land\n\\forall\\vec A\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,\\kappa,\\mathcal P(\\kappa))\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(\\vec A(\\alpha)\\subseteq\\alpha)\n\\to\n\\exists A\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\n\\mathrm{Stationary}\n(\\{\\alpha\\in\\kappa:A\\cap\\alpha=\\vec A(\\alpha)\\},\\kappa)\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The sequence is a set function into <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\)</span>; the former codomain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> was a proper class and therefore could not be the codomain of the upstream set-function predicate.</li>\n<li>An ineffable cardinal has a stationary set of &quot;homogeneous&quot; subsets.</li>\n<li>Ineffable cardinals imply <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^1_2\">\\(\\Pi^1_2\\)</span>-indescribability.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-stationary.md","status":"resolved","id":"b802c3dd76418d95","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-stationary.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,\\vec A,A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{Stationary}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ineffable}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ineffable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ineffable}(\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\omega_1\\subseteq\\kappa\n\\land\n\\forall\\vec A\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,\\kappa,\\mathcal P(\\kappa))\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(\\vec A(\\alpha)\\subseteq\\alpha)\n\\to\n\\exists A\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\n\\mathrm{Stationary}\n(\\{\\alpha\\in\\kappa:A\\cap\\alpha=\\vec A(\\alpha)\\},\\kappa)\n\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi^1_2","display":false}],"bytes":1353,"backlinks":[{"id":"4341cd647245a907","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ineffable}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (ineffable-cardinal predicate, see [[58-df-ineffable]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-676","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-ineffable.md|58-df-ineffable]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["5fb1c2241d1943d1","b802c3dd76418d95","0fbfc19800246e77","36d7463d215be751"]}